WEBVTT

00:07:57.927 --> 00:08:02.791
before any tourist can go
to any major city on the planet

00:08:02.815 --> 00:08:05.466
with a little earbud
or something in their ear

00:08:05.490 --> 00:08:08.497
and just have a conversation
in real time with anyone,

00:08:08.521 --> 00:08:10.403
in any of the world's major languages?

00:08:10.427 --> 00:08:12.014
KFL: Yeah, you picked a good one.

00:08:12.038 --> 00:08:15.783
We're almost there with this one,
I think in about three years.

00:08:15.807 --> 00:08:20.781
We're basically just cleaning up
the engineering hard edges

00:08:20.805 --> 00:08:23.760
to make the product flow more smoothly.

00:08:23.784 --> 00:08:26.775
We already have text-to-text translation,

00:08:26.799 --> 00:08:29.529
speech recognition is getting
more and more accurate,

00:08:29.553 --> 00:08:33.472
and speech synthesis is getting
more and more humanlike.